2956|n|An Australian insectivorous singing bird (Pachycephala gutturalis). The male is conspicuously marked with black and yellow, and has a black crescent on the breast. Called also white-throated thickhead, orange-breasted thrust, black-crowned thrush, guttural thrush, and black-breasted flycatcher.	v:2dwh,26,5~2dwh,26,5	n:262b,163,3;19yi,28,8~19yi,28,8;262b,163,3	N:19xh,125,6~19xh,125,6
